OL,3,GNEWSAWrestler hopes career will inspire
OL,4,Anext generation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA professional wrestler, who is
OL,7,Fpreparing to step into the ring one
OL,8,Flast time after 29 years, said he hoped
OL,9,Fto inspire young people into the sport.
OL,11,FTristian Hayes, 45, from Salisbury,
OL,12,FWiltshire, first discovered his own
OL,13,Fpassion for wrestling when, aged 11,
OL,14,Fhis late father took him to Salisbury
OL,15,FCity Hall in 1992 to watch British
OL,16,Fwrestling legend Giant Haystacks.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
