OL,3,GNEWSAWrestler hopes career will inspire
OL,4,Anext generation
OL,5,
OL,6,FHayes has competed across the world,
OL,7,Fincluding tours in the United States
OL,8,Fand Australia, and is taking part in
OL,9,FRing Wrestling Stars: Salisbury
OL,10,FSlamdown at Salisbury City Hall on 13
OL,11,FSeptember.
OL,13,FHe said: "To end my in-ring journey at
OL,14,FSalisbury City Hall is deeply
OL,15,Fmeaningful to me, even more so after my
OL,16,Fdad passed away earlier this year."
